===Etymology 1===
From {{compound|cat|fish}}. Likely so named for its prominent [[barbel]]s like a [[cat#English|cat]]'s [[whisker]]s.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|catfish|pl2=catfishes}}

# Any fish of the order [[Siluriformes]], that are mainly found in [[freshwater]], are without [[scale]]s, and have [[barbel]]s like [[whisker]]s around the mouth.

